---
const { seriesTitle, seriesUrl } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class="not-prose mb-8 rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-200/60 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-base-content/75">
  本文屬於
  <a href={seriesUrl} class="font-medium text-primary transition-colors duration-200 hover:underline">
    {seriesTitle}
  </a>
  ，可回系列頁查看完整脈絡。
</aside>
